# Git author for this repo

When creating git commits in this repository:

- Author must be `JoeSio <joe_sio@hotmail.com>`
- Do not ask the user to restate the author each time
- Prefer the repo-local `user.name` / `user.email` (already set). If a commit must override, use `--author="JoeSio <joe_sio@hotmail.com>"`
- Do not change global git config; only this repo's local config is allowed for identity
